| Freeze / completeness | `buildEdition.ts`, `librarySelection.ts` |
| Full standard (human) | `docs/editorial/MASTERPIECE_EDITORIAL_STANDARD.md` |

## Anti-patterns (reject at ingest)

- Opening with invitation copy ("Step closer", "Imagine standing…")
- Generic movement filler without verified specifics
- Editorial Reflection that repeats museum name, license, or historical facts
- Same fact in Overview and About the Artist
- Did You Know that restates the lead paragraph
- Synthesized detail when library record lacks approved scholarly body
